# Fixture for the PURE file-type detection helpers (tests/t_port_file_type.c).
# One op per line: image <path>  or  binary <path>.
# Extension-only rule (case-insensitive). .pdf is NOT binary (text). .ico IS image.

# === images (.ico included) ===
image photo.png
image pic.JPEG
image icon.ico
image animated.gif
image logo.webp
image snap.bmp

# === binaries (various classes) ===
binary prog.exe
binary lib.so
binary archive.zip
binary movie.mp4
binary song.mp3
binary doc.docx
binary data.sqlite3
binary model.bin
binary font.ttf
binary page.pdf

# === neither (text / source) ===
binary notes.txt
binary script.py
binary readme.md
binary config.json
binary data.csv
image code.c
image notes.txt
image script.py

# === no extension / dotfile ===
binary Makefile
image .gitignore
binary path/with/noext
